{
  "version": 8,
  "name": "People of color",
  "metadata": {
    "description": "Share of residents who are not non-Hispanic white alone, pale blue through violet to deep purple. Measured over all 3,222 counties with a published value: 7 classes with breaks at 7%/12%/20%/36%/58%/75%, which fall at the 10th/31st/49th/70th/88th/95th percentile of the national distribution.",
